# Why an action, not a service: this runs for minutes, needs to stream
# progress while driving (req 4), and must be cancellable mid-flight (req 6).
# A service is fire-and-return-immediately — wrong shape for a long task.

# --- Goal: sent once, when the delivery starts ---
string job_id
NamedLocation pickup
NamedLocation dropoff
---
# --- Result: sent once, when the action ends (success, failure, or cancel) ---
bool success
string result_message
string failed_leg
---
# --- Feedback: streamed repeatedly (>=1/sec) while the action runs ---
string current_leg
NamedLocation heading_to
float64 distance_remaining